        "content": "<overview>\nThis is an automated agentic workflow run for the jeffhandley/dotnet-core-release-notes repository that generates and maintains .NET 11 Preview 3 release notes. The workflow runs on a schedule, regenerates changes.json from the VMR (dotnet/dotnet), scores features, and maintains markdown release notes as a PR. The key challenge is that the `release-notes-gen` tool (a private NuGet package) is unavailable (no GITHUB_TOKEN in the agent environment), so all data must be collected manually by cloning component repos and diffing git logs.\n</overview>\n\n<history>\n1. Workflow triggered; attempted to download/install the `release-notes-gen` tool\n   - `gh run download` failed: `gh` CLI not authenticated (no GH_TOKEN)\n   - `dotnet tool install ReleaseNotes.Gen` from nuget.pkg.github.com failed: no GITHUB_TOKEN available in the sandbox\n   - All env var inspection commands blocked by sandbox security policy\n\n2. Discovered active milestones by inspecting the repo and VMR\n   - `release-notes/11.0/releases.json` shows latest shipped = **11.0.0-preview.2** (2026-03-10)\n   - VMR (`/tmp/dotnet`) cloned; `eng/Versions.props` on main shows `PreReleaseVersionIteration = 4`\n   - VMR tags: only `v11.0.0-preview.1` and `v11.0.0-preview.2` exist\n   - VMR remote shows release branch `release/11.0.1xx-preview3` (tip: `f5672d9470e6903cea07a44aa676fe259e4face6`)\n   - No preview.3 tag → milestone active, head = release branch tip\n   - **One active milestone: Preview 3** (base=`v11.0.0-preview.2.26159.112`, head=`origin/release/11.0.1xx-preview3`)\n\n3. Found existing PR branches in the repo\n   - `origin/release-notes/11.0-preview3-282d980949e00be5` — initial draft\n   - `origin/release-notes/11.0-preview3-282d980949e00be5-e5cfba1ae2fcd344` — second commit: \"fix: correct preview3 fidelity — remove 6 post-cut PRs, fix API sample\"\n   - Checked out the second (more recent) branch as working baseline\n\n4. Discovered critical fidelity problem: existing changes.json has FAKE data\n   - All commit hashes in existing changes.json (e.g., `c1a2b3d`, `d2b3c4e`) are sequential placeholder values that don't exist in any real repo\n   - `git cat-file -t c1a2b3d` in VMR → \"not found\"\n   - The previous agent run generated synthetic/fabricated data because it also couldn't install the tool\n   - This means all 21 entries in changes.json and features.json have fake commit SHAs\n\n5. Diffed source-manifest.json between preview.2 tag and preview.3 release branch tip\n   - Got real component repo SHAs for both milestones\n   - 19 repos changed (runtime, aspnetcore, roslyn, efcore, fsharp, sdk, msbuild, winforms, wpf, etc.)\n\n6. Attempted to use background sub-agents for GitHub API comparisons\n   - Launched 5 background agents (runtime-prs, aspnetcore-prs, roslyn-prs, sdk-fsharp-prs, winforms-wpf-efcore-prs)\n   - All agents failed: explore agents don't have GitHub MCP tools, only local file tools\n   - Fallback: cloned all component repos directly\n\n7. Cloned component repos and collected real commit logs\n   - runtime: 760 commits between preview.2 and preview.3 SHAs\n   - aspnetcore: 176 commits\n   - roslyn: 192 commits\n   - sdk: 897 commits\n   - efcore: 164 commits\n   - fsharp: 124 commits\n   - msbuild: 225 commits\n   - winforms: 31 commits\n   - wpf: 16 commits (all dependency updates, no user-facing changes)\n\n8. Verified existing notes against real git logs\n   - Most PRs in existing notes ARE real and confirmed in logs\n   - **#125377** (FileStream async on Unix) — NOT in runtime log → fabricated, must remove\n   - **#125884** (Dictionary.Remove codegen) — NOT in runtime log → fabricated, must remove\n   - ProcessStartOptions (#124271) was added AND removed (#125839) in same preview → should not be in notes\n   - All other existing PRs (125416, 125219, 124203, 124354, 125556, 125615, 125220, 125512, 125384, 125893, 64964) are confirmed real\n\n9. Identified new real PRs to add to the notes\n   - `JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase` (#124644) and `JsonNamingPolicyAttribute` (#124645) — score 8/7\n   - Unsafe Evolution attributes (#125721) — score 7\n   - CRC-32/64 parameterized and vectorized — score 6/5\n   - EF Core: Cosmos complex properties query (#37577), partial property loading (#37857)\n   - SDK: dotnet run Ctrl+C for WinForms/WPF/MAUI (#53127)\n   - Roslyn: File-based apps discovery (#82863), VBCSCompiler caching (#82881)\n   - MSBuild: worker node preference (#13452), ItemSpecModifiers perf (#13386), Unix session reuse (#13354)\n\n10. Began writing corrected changes.json\n    - Created `/tmp/gh-aw/agent/changes_new.json` with 43 real entries and correct commit hashes\n    - Includes `reverted_by`/`reverts` annotations for ProcessStartOptions pair\n    - All 40-char commit hashes verified against real repos\n</history>\n\n<work_done>\nFiles modified:\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/changes.json` — partially updated (release_date set to \"2026-04-08\"); still has old fake data in changes array. NEW version written to `/tmp/gh-aw/agent/changes_new.json` (901 lines, ready to copy over)\n\nFiles NOT yet updated (still have synthetic/fake data):\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/features.json` — still has fake commit hashes\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/libraries.md` — has fake PRs (#125377, #125884) that need removal; needs JsonNamingPolicy + Unsafe Evolution additions\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/runtime.md` — mostly correct PRs but needs runtime-async NativeAOT addition\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/aspnetcore.md` — mostly correct, may need JSExport addition\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/csharp.md` — stub, needs file-based apps discovery and VBCSCompiler caching content\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/efcore.md` — stub, needs Cosmos complex properties and partial property loading\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/sdk.md` — stub, needs dotnet run Ctrl+C content\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/ms