ded (#124271) then removed (#125839) within preview.3 → score 0 with `reverted_by` annotation, exclude from prose\n- `#125377` (FileStream async on Unix) and `#125884` (Dictionary.Remove) are fabricated — must be removed from libraries.md\n- WPF has no user-facing changes (all dependency updates)\n- WinForms has only bugfixes (no headline features)\n- F# has only regression tests and minor fixes (no headline features)\n\n**Working branch:** `work/preview3-check` (checked out from `origin/release-notes/11.0-preview3-282d980949e00be5-e5cfba1ae2fcd344`)\n**Target PR branch:** needs to be one of the two existing branches or a new one\n\n**New changes.json:** `/tmp/gh-aw/agent/changes_new.json` (901 lines, complete, ready to copy)\n- 43 change entries with real commit hashes\n- Includes VMR commit references for dotnet@ea94acb, dotnet@b346c36, dotnet@3a162e0, dotnet@1ea751f, dotnet@2b8c81a, dotnet@093e119, dotnet@ecb402e, dotnet@f93176f, dotnet@02092ee, dotnet@fb047b2\n\n**Key PRs confirmed real (runtime):**\n- #124203 (crossgen2 runtime-async), #124354 (thunk GetNativeCodeInfo), #125556 (continuation reuse), #125615 (unmutated locals JIT)\n- #125416 (GC regions macOS), #125219 (JIT SDSU intervals)\n- #124644 (JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase), #124645 (JsonNamingPolicyAttribute)\n- #125721 (unsafe evolution attributes)\n- #125220 (SafeFileHandle.CreateAnonymousPipe), #125512 (RandomAccess non-seekable), #125384 (WebProxy credentials)\n- #125893 (HashSet<T> perf)\n- #126343 (runtime-async shared framework)\n\n**Key PRs confirmed real (other repos):**\n- aspnetcore: #64964 (Virtualize variable-height)\n- efcore: #37577 (Cosmos complex properties query), #37857 (partial property loading)\n- sdk: #53127 (dotnet run Ctrl+C)\n- roslyn: #82863 (file-based apps discovery), #82881 (VBCSCompiler caching)\n- msbuild: #13452, #13386, #13354\n</technical_details>\n\n<important_files>\n- `release-notes/11.0/preview/preview3/changes.json`\n  - Core machine-readable manifest; currently has 